  "description": "Add whimsical, retro charm to your holiday projects with this Christmas Digital Paper Bundle — a collection of 6 playful digital papers featuring a wavy plaid check, garland-style scattered stars, striped star rows, festive Christmas trees with stars, polka-dot stars in circles, and a checkered wavy stripe design, all in a cheerful red, pink, and green holiday palette.\nEach pattern is crafted at 3600×3600 px, 300 DPI and comes in three flexible file formats — SVG, JPG, and EPS — giving you fully editable vector artwork alongside high-resolution raster files, perfect for both print and digital Christmas-themed projects.\nPerfect for:\nChristmas & holiday gift wrap and packaging\nDigital scrapbooking & junk journals\nParty & event decor (banners, backdrops, invitations)\nHoliday stationery, cards & tags\nHome decor mockups (stockings, wraps, ornaments)\nWebsite & social media seasonal backgrounds\nPlanner covers, stickers & printables\nWhat’s Included:\n✔ 6 unique Christmas-themed seamless patterns\n✔ SVG (fully editable, layered vector files)\n✔ EPS (vector format for print & design software)\n✔ JPG (print-ready high resolution)\n✔ 3600 x 3600 px / 300 DPI\n✔ Seamless & tileable design — no visible repeat lines\n✔ Instant digital download\nThese patterns are 100% original designs, making them safe and versatile for commercial and personal creative use.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Add whimsical, retro charm to your holiday projects with this Christmas Digital Paper Bundle — a collection of 6 playful digital papers featuring a wavy plaid check, garland-style scattered stars, striped star rows, festive Christmas trees with stars, polka-dot stars in circles, and a checkered wavy stripe design, all in a cheerful red, pink, and green holiday palette.</p>\n<p>Each pattern is crafted at 3600×3600 px, 300 DPI and comes in three flexible file formats — SVG, JPG, and EPS — giving you fully editable vector artwork alongside high-resolution raster files, perfect for both print and digital Christmas-themed projects.</p>\n<p>Perfect for:</p>\n<p>Christmas &amp; holiday gift wrap and packaging<br>\nDigital scrapbooking &amp; junk journals<br>\nParty &amp; event decor (banners, backdrops, invitations)<br>\nHoliday stationery, cards &amp; tags<br>\nHome decor mockups (stockings, wraps, ornaments)<br>\nWebsite &amp; social media seasonal backgrounds<br>\nPlanner covers, stickers &amp; printables</p>\n<p>What’s Included:<br>\n✔ 6 unique Christmas-themed seamless patterns<br>\n✔ SVG (fully editable, layered vector files)<br>\n✔ EPS (vector format for print &amp; design software)<br>\n✔ JPG (print-ready high resolution)<br>\n✔ 3600 x 3600 px / 300 DPI<br>\n✔ Seamless &amp; tileable design — no visible repeat lines<br>\n✔ Instant digital download</p>\n<p>These patterns are 100% original designs, making them safe and versatile for commercial and personal creative use.</p>",
